1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Ancient Persians stored ice through desert summers—without electricity.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Winter basins froze thin layers of water overnight.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Tall walls shaded ice; yakhchāls insulated underground storage.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Climate and thermal mass worked together.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
What can observation solve today?
